        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You conjure a great silver lance and hurl it, piercing your foes. The spear is made of silver and deals 12d6 piercing damage. If the target is a fiend, it deals an additional @Damage[(2 * @item.level)d6[spirit]] damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage. If the creature is a fiend, the spear magically tethers it. For 1 minute, any teleportation actions it attempts are disrupted unless it first succeeds at a @Check[flat|dc:11].</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes full damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The piercing damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against fiends increases by 2d6.</p>"
